{"G1116":{"id":"G1116","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1116","disambiguated_id":"G1116 = the Greek of","unique_id":"H6017","headword":"Γόμορρα","transliteration":"Gomorra","lexical_morphology":"N:N--L","gloss_en":"Gomorrah","definition_en":"Γόμορρα, -ας, ἡ, and -ων, τά (Heb. עֲמֹרָה), \n Gomorrah, one of the cities of the plain (Gen.19): Mat.10:15, Rom.9:29\" (LXX), 2Pe.2:6, Ju 7.†\n (AS)","source_line":1247}],"occurrence_count":4,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"Gomorra","count":4}]},"G1405":{"id":"G1405","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1405","disambiguated_id":"G1405 =","unique_id":"G1405","headword":"δράσσομαι","transliteration":"drassomai","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to catch","definition_en":"δράσσομαι \n [in LXX for נָשַׁק pi., Psa.2:12; elsewhere קָמַץ, as Lev.2:2 ;] \nto grasp with the hand, to lay hold of: metaphorically, with accusative (M, Pr., 65), 1Co.3:19 (LXX).†\n (AS)","source_line":1537}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"toma","count":1}]},"G1534":{"id":"G1534","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1534","disambiguated_id":"G1534 =","unique_id":"G1534","headword":"εἶτα","transliteration":"eita","lexical_morphology":"G:ADV","gloss_en":"then","definition_en":"εἶτα \n adv., \ndenoting sequence; \n __1. of time; then, next: Mrk.8:25, Luk.8:12, Jhn.13:5 19:27 20:27, 1Ti.3:10, Jas.1:15; before genitive abs., Mrk.4:17; in enumerations, 1Co.15:5 15:7 15:24, 1Ti.2:13. \n __2. In argument; \n __(a) therefore, then, \n __(b) furthermore: Heb.12:9 (cf. εἶτεν).†\n (AS)","source_line":1674}],"occurrence_count":15,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"depois","count":14},{"gloss":"então","count":1}]},"G1578":{"id":"G1578","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1578","disambiguated_id":"G1578 =","unique_id":"G1578","headword":"ἐκκλίνω","transliteration":"ekklinō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to turn from","definition_en":"ἐκ-κλίνω \n [in LXX for נָטָה, סוּר, etc. ;] \nintran